n":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"StreamDurability"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TOffset"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"batch","children":[{"type":"text","value":"batch?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"number"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"debug","children":[{"type":"text","value":"debug?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/DebugOption.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"DebugOption"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"toffset","text":"TOffset","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"socket","text":"socket","level":3},{"id":"options","text":"options","level":3},{"id":"adapter","text":"adapter","level":4},{"id":"batch","text":"batch?","level":4},{"id":"debug","text":"debug?","level":4},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction resumeWebSocketStream<TOffset>(socket, options): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts:307](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts#L307)\n\nRead-only replay of a run's durability log over a socket (mirrors\n`resumeServerSentEventsResponse`). The adapter captures the offset from the\nrequest (`?offset`/`Last-Event-ID`); no model runs. Closes 1008 when there\nis nothing to resume.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TOffset\n\n`TOffset` *extends* `string` = `string`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### socket\n\n[`WebSocketLike`](../interfaces/WebSocketLike.md)\n\n### options\n\n#### adapter\n\n[`StreamDurability`](../interfaces/StreamDurability.md)\\<`TOffset`\\>\n\n#### batch?\n\n`number`\n\n#### debug?\n\n[`DebugOption`](../type-aliases/DebugOption.md)\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: resumeWebSocketStream\ntitle: resumeWebSocketStream\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction resumeWebSocketStream<TOffset>(socket, options): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts:307](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts#L307)\n\nRead-only replay of a run's durability log over a socket (mirrors\n`resumeServerSentEventsResponse`). The adapter captures the offset from the\nrequest (`?offset`/`Last-Event-ID`); no model runs. Closes 1008 when there\nis nothing to resume.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TOffset\n\n`TOffset` *extends* `string` = `string`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### socket\n\n[`WebSocketLike`](../interfaces/WebSocketLike.md)\n\n### options\n\n#### adapter\n\n[`StreamDurability`](../interfaces/StreamDurability.md)\\<`TOffset`\\>\n\n#### batch?\n\n`number`\n\n#### debug?\n\n[`DebugOption`](../type-aliases/DebugOption.md)\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n"}
